  "details": "Basically use data and show people their most used avatar over the year for public and private avatars and worlds per each user would be a nice edition to VRChat you could add a few things into the recap such as :\n\n1.Your Top Avatars of the year: how many days straight you've used the avatar without changing and or just stop avatars over the year that you mostly used.\n\n2.Your top worlds of the year: with hour count of how long you spent in the  specific world and maybe other statistics about your top world\n\n3.Most said thing in your text box? \n\n4.time spent loading.\n\n5.time spent in VR vs desktop and or mobile\n\n6. show data of your friend you talk to and join the most (VRChat besties) \n\n7. random facts about your friends maybe like ( you knew this person for x days that's almost x years in cat years or something\n\n8.Longest VRChat session\n\n9. total number of avatars used/ world visited\n\n10. top emotes/prints/stickers\n\n11. Number of friends made over the year\n\n12.Favorite Time of Day to Play\n\nhere's just a few i could think of i really hope this helps",
